<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pairgain cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pairgain cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston cut its rating of PairGain Technologies Inc to a hold from its prior rating of buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 4-3/4 to 76 in early trading.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Mike Schmidt was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
